ForwardModule_Validate
├── when recipient is zero address
│   └── it should return false with "Zero recipient address"
├── when amount is below minimum
│   └── it should return false with "Amount below minimum"
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return false with "Insufficient balance"
├── when multiple validations fail
│   └── it should return the first failing validation
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should return true with empty reason
    ├── it should return true when amount equals minimum
    └── it should return true for any valid input [fuzz]
